observations = Array[String](["Four hooks with label tape: HOUSE, CAR, SHED, GARAGE. The GARAGE hook is empty.", "The car keys have a paper tag from Dorsey Motors.", "Under the empty hook, the varnish is rubbed into a little arc where a key used to swing."])
